msgid "This prompt acts as a dictionary for the highlighted text, to a word or phrase."
msgstr "Iste instruction age como dictionario pro le texto sublineate, a un parola o phrase."

msgid "This prompt analyzes the grammar of the highlighted text, providing a detailed explanation of its structure and any grammatical errors."
msgstr "Iste instruction analysa le grammatica del texto sublineate, providendo un explication detaliate de su structura e de ulle errores grammatical."

msgid "This prompt analyzes the vocabulary of the highlighted text, identifying complex words and providing definitions, synonyms, and usage examples."
msgstr "Iste instruction analysa le vocabulario del texto sublineate, identificando parolas complexe e providendo definitiones, synonymos, e exemplos de uso."

msgid "This prompt creates a structured system for generating context-aware definitions of words or phrases from literature by analyzing the highlighted term within its surrounding text to provide nuanced explanations that capture both literal meaning and contextual significance."
msgstr "Iste instruction crea un systema structurate pro generar definitiones contextual de parolas o phrases ex litteratura, analysando le termino sublineate in su texto circumjacente pro provider explicationes nuanciate que captura tanto le significato literal como le significantia contextual."

msgid "This prompt explains the highlighted text as if to a five-year-old, simplifying complex concepts into easily understandable terms."
msgstr "Iste instruction explica le texto sublineate como si a un infante de cinque annos, simplificando conceptos complexe in terminos facilemente comprensibile."

msgid "This prompt explains the highlighted text in detail, ensuring clarity and understanding."
msgstr "Iste instruction explica le texto sublineate in detalio, assecurando claritate e comprension."

msgid "This prompt extracts and lists the key points from the highlighted text, ensuring clarity and organization."
msgstr "Iste instruction extrahe e lista le punctos clave del texto sublineate, assecurando claritate e organisation."

msgid "This prompt generates a comprehensive Wikipedia-style article based on the highlighted text, ensuring factual accuracy and neutrality."
msgstr "Iste instruction genera un articulo comprehensive in stilo Wikipedia basate sur le texto sublineate, assecurando exactitude factual e neutralitate."

msgid "This prompt provides a detailed historical context for the highlighted text, explaining its significance and background."
msgstr "Iste instruction provide un contexto historic detaliate pro le texto sublineate, explicando su significantia e fundo."

msgid "This prompt simplifies the highlighted text to make it easier to understand."
msgstr "Iste instruction simplifica le texto sublineate pro facer lo plus facile a comprender."

msgid "This prompt summarizes the highlighted text, capturing its main points and essential details."
msgstr "Iste instruction summarisa le texto sublineate, capturando su punctos principal e detalios essential."

msgid "This prompt translates the highlighted text to another language."
msgstr "Iste instruction traduce le texto sublineate a un altere lingua."

